1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:05,100
Floating between Mars and Jupiter sits an asteroid that breaks global economics.

2
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:08,990
16 Psyche is a hundred-and-forty-mile-wide slab of solid metal.

3
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:12,840
Scientists believe it is the exposed core of a dead protoplanet.

4
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,760
Pause — guess how much all its gold and platinum is worth.

5
00:00:18,570 --> 00:00:21,320
It is valued at ten thousand quadrillion dollars.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,130
That is enough wealth to make every human on Earth a billionaire.

7
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:31,060
But dragging it back to Earth would instantly collapse the entire world economy.

8
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:35,700
Flooding supply would render gold completely worthless overnight.

9
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,880
Which is why nobody touches the rock...
